    {
      "id": "note_cfg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "📖 **图解**\n\n敏感凭证（企微密钥、SMTP密码）只在\n.env出现，代码零硬编码；Settings统一\n校验后按字段前缀分发给各模块：\nWECOM_*→WeComAPIClient，SMTP_*→\nmail_sender，DATABASE_URL→db，\nADMIN_EMAILS/EXCLUDED_NAMES→\nservices层，DEFAULT_COMPANY_A/B→\nroster_sync。CLI的--date/--final走\n另一条路径，传入service层控制审计\n目标日和月审类型。",
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
